// §66.6.2 rule 2 (S483 r2) — every branch mounts the declaration through another declaration's
// render: `<pa>` and `<pb>` each render `<card/>`, and card's `if=` / `else` chain mounts one of them.
<program>
<pa t:string="a">
</> renders <b><card/></b>
<pb t:string="b">
</> renders <i><card/></i>
<card d:int=3>
</> renders <span><pa if=(d > 0)/><pb else/></span>
<main id="o"><card/></main>
</program>
